POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "" }

### 33b. Whitespace-only reply - 400 errors.Body
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "   \n  " }

### 33c. Missing body - 400 errors.Body
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{}

### 34. Empty note - 400 errors.Body
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "" }

### 35. Empty customer reply - 400 errors.Body
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/customer-replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "" }

### 36. The ticket - 200: firstRespondedAtUtc still equal to request 3's
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 37. A reply of exactly 10,000 characters - 200 (body read from a fixture file)
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

< ./data/ticket-thread-body-10000.json

### 38. A note of 10,001 characters - 400 errors.Body
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

< ./data/ticket-thread-body-10001.json

### 39a. Unknown visibility - 400 errors.Visibility[0] (custom text)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?visibility=secret
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 39b. limit 0 - 400 errors.Limit
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?limit=0
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 39c. after -1 - 400 errors.After
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?after=-1
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 40a. limit 100 - 200
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 40b. limit 101 - 400 errors.Limit
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?limit=101
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

###############################################################################################################################
### Not found, scope, authentication, localisation
###############################################################################################################################

### 41a. Unknown ticket, thread - 404 Tickets.TicketNotFound
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{unknown}}/thread
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 41b. Unknown ticket, reply - 404 Tickets.TicketNotFound
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{unknown}}/replies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "Hello" }

### 42a. Thread of a JED-CARE ticket as agent A - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{redSeaNewTicket}}/thread
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 42b. Same, public path - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{redSeaNewTicket}}/thread?visibility=public
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

### 42c. Note on a JED-CARE ticket as agent A - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
POST {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{redSeaNewTicket}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}

{ "body": "Out of scope" }

### 43. Agent B reads agent A's thread - 403 Organisation.OutOfScope
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread
Authorization: Bearer {{agentBToken}}

### 44. Supervisor reads it - 200 (RYD-CARE member); people names agent A and the supervisor where they acted
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 45. No token - 401
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread

### 46. Arabic request language - 200, body identical to the English response: no server-rendered text (activities are template keys)
GET {{host}}/api/Agent/Tickets/{{thId}}/thread?limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{agentAToken}}
Accept-Language: ar
